18. **[^](#fnrefdvbifbusf3)** This term may be intuitive and rhetorically powerful. That said, its connotations (e.g. indicating extreme power) may increase some actors’ interest in risky AI acceleration or deployment by “their side”, even if aiming for this increase accident risk.
19. **[^](#fnrefj2sfjacvyj)** Many of the systems that are relevant to AI governance are (currently) LLMs. That said, LLMs feel to me like a *specific example* of the type of system that one might want to discuss. RL agents are another example in this category.
